flowchart TD
    BA[Boolean Algebra] --> AXI[Axioms]
    BA --> DUAL[Duality]
    BA --> ID[Boolean Identities]
    BA --> FUNC[Boolean Functions]
    BA --> GATE[Logic Gates]
    BA --> MIN[Circuit Minimization]
    BA --> DESIGN[Digital Circuit Design]

    AXI --> A1[Identity: x+0=x, x-1=x]
    AXI --> A2[Complement: x+x=1, x-x=0]
    AXI --> A3[Commutative: x+y=y+x]
    AXI --> A4[Associative: x+y+z = x+y+z]
    AXI --> A5[Distributive: xy+z = xy+xz]

    DUAL --> D1["Swap + and dot"]
    DUAL --> D2["Swap 0 and 1"]

    ID --> I1[Idempotent: x+x = x]
    ID --> I2[Domination: x+1 = 1]
    ID --> I3[Absorption: x+xy = x]
    ID --> I4["De Morgan: x+y = x-y"]
    ID --> I5[Double complement]

    FUNC --> F1[SOP sum of products]
    FUNC --> F2[POS product of sums]
    FUNC --> F3[Canonical forms]
    FUNC --> F4[Truth table representation]

    GATE --> G1[AND OR NOT]
    GATE --> G2[NAND NOR XOR]
    GATE --> G3[Functional completeness]

    MIN --> M1[Karnaugh Maps]
    MIN --> M2[Quine McCluskey]
    MIN --> M3[Don t Care Conditions]
    M1 --> M1A[Group adjacent 1s]
    M1 --> M1B[Prime implicants]
    M1 --> M1C[Minimal cover]

    DESIGN --> P1[Truth table to expression]
    P1 --> P2[Minimize expression]
    P2 --> P3[Draw logic circuit]
